              "text": "सुंदर (sundar) is Sanskrit sundara, \"beautiful\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama (CDIAL 13474). CDIAL asks whether the Sanskrit word is itself a Middle Indo-Aryan form of sūnara, \"excellent\"."
